ingfisher-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Kingfisher County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. In 2025 the middle saw March to April at 175% of normal and November to December at just 29%. Grid 19328 had its driest year in 1956, at 44% of normal.</p>"}
